<h2>Benefits</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Suppresses stray light, scattering, and solar glint from membranes and precision optical edges.</li>
    <li>Tailorable BRDF and thermal emissivity within a single coating design.</li>
    <li>Radiation-hardened formulations retain performance in the space environment.</li>
    <li>Compatible with roll-to-roll coating of large flexible membranes.</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2>Applications</h2>
<ul>
    <li>Direct imaging of exoplanets with starshades.</li>
    <li>Stray-light and glint suppression in optical and sensor systems.</li>
    <li>Precision occulters and light-blocking membranes.</li>
</ul>
